{"title": "Fury In The Marrow", "pageid": 28352, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fury_In_The_Marrow", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fury In The Marrow</b> is a passive feature that damages enemies when you rage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\">Rage</a>, hostile creatures in a 3 m (10 ft) radius must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Action DC Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon Action DC</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage. The targets receive half damage on a save. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Helmet\" title=\"Bonespike Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Bonespike_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Helmet\" title=\"Bonespike Helmet\">Bonespike Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The 2-8 <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span> damage mentioned in the description of Fury in the Marrow is, specifically, 2d4 <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span> damage.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Hostile creatures that succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against Fury In The Marrow receive no damage instead of half damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200707\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1544/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12926/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4897/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 826757/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.045      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   44.045      1 -total\n 32.71%   14.409      3 Template:Icon_text\n 31.39%   13.827     21 Template:Trim\n 31.08%   13.691      2 Template:Icon_link\n 28.70%   12.641      1 Template:SAI\n 23.03%   10.142  